  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The FF9 plugin now has a real, format-aware editor path instead of a scaffold. It reads Memoria/Hades CSV exports for items, item effects, weapons, armor, support abilities, battle actions, character base stats, shops, and synthesis; uses shared Table + Detail views; validates stored scalar types; and saves only atomic project overlays under StreamingAssets/Data. The installed Steam copy is build 5378074 and contains only vanilla p0data containers, with no Memoria/Hades CSV export, so its records are not yet editable. Lexeditor leaves those containers untouched and reports the missing export clearly. Enemies, encounters, direct p0data extraction, and in-game acceptance remain open.",
